# Contact Form Endpoint
# Set this to your Formspree or Web3Forms endpoint to enable form submissions.
#
# Formspree: https://formspree.io — create a free form and paste the endpoint here
# Example: VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID
#
# Web3Forms: https://web3forms.com — get a free access key and use:
# Example: VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit
#
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
